<%# FUIME: shown to the OPERATOR only, on their own storefront and pay pages,
    while Sandbox Mode is on. See FuimeHelper#sandbox_rehearsal?.

    A customer never sees this, because for a customer nothing is different —
    which is also the reassurance the banner leads with, since the founder's
    first worry on seeing it is "wait, am I losing sales?" %>
<% if sandbox_rehearsal?(event) %>
  <div class="card border b--info mb-6 text-center">
    <p class="mt-0 mb-0 font-semibold">Test mode — this is a rehearsal</p>
    <p class="muted mb-0 text-sm">
      Your Buy won't charge a card or move money. Customers still pay normally.
      <%= link_to "Test mode settings", fuime_sandbox_path(event_slug: event.slug), class: "underline" %>
    </p>
  </div>
<% end %>
